							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=751.msg6749#msg6749"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=751.msg6749#msg6749">Re:Good guild going bad</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> April 06, 2004, 02:07:20 pm &#187;</span></td>
