							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well, we treat everyone with the respect that they deserve.. &nbsp;I didn&#039;t mean that we only treat clerics with respect ;D.. &nbsp;Anyways as I read more.. &nbsp;<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">WHOEVER gave you a *removal from guild* talk because yo ucalled skip is an asshole and should be removed themselves. I may not be an officer but I&#039;m a member, which is JUST AS IMPORTANT. <br /></div><br />Officers are no different then members or leader or whatnot.. &nbsp;We are all people in a game trying to advance in a virtual world. &nbsp;Officers are more or less there to keep the peace/and stop chaos through policies (that hopefully make sense), and other means..
