								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=751.msg6752#msg6752">Re:Good guild going bad</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> April 06, 2004, 02:18:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
