							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Before we play the &quot;poor oppressed and down trodden soul&quot; syndrom, this &quot;skip&quot; thing has been going on for quite some time. Halius has been told to never &quot;skip&quot; again numerous times and has fallen on deaf ears each time.<br />The typical repsonce has always been &quot;ok, I&#039;ve got it&quot;, or &quot;don&#039;t worry, it&#039;s under control&quot;. But seeing as it&#039;s an ongoing problem , its indeed not &quot;under control&quot;, as stated.<br /></div><br />It is true that hal could just NOT call a skip.. If he woulda said FIZZLED! would you be flipping out?? &nbsp;
						</td>
					</tr>
